 ...elax-ETSI-EDCCA-threshold-on-2.4-GHz.patch |  58 +++++++
 ...load-the-reserved-page-synchronously.patch | 164 ++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 223 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 package/kernel/mac80211/patches/rtl/054-wifi-rtw88-8822b-Relax-ETSI-EDCCA-threshold-on-2.4-GHz.patch
